      "content": "i know, i know... everyone says that stuff about walking or talking to someone but it doesnt actually change the fact that i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone around me. it feels like i'm just taking up space. is it ever actually okay to just give up on everything for good? like just... stop trying to fix things that are clearly broken?",
